[18.292, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[97m\u25cf\u001b[39m I renamed \u001b[94mLineItem.price\u001b[28G\u001b[39mto \u001b[94munitPrice\u001b[41G\u001b[39min\u001b[44G\u001b[94msrc/billing.ts\u001b[39m.\u001b[60GThe\u001b[64Ginterface\u001b[74Gfield\u001b[80Gand\u001b[84Gthe\u001b[88Gone\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Buse in \u001b[94mtotal()\u001b[18G\u001b[39mnow\u001b[22Gread\u001b[27G\u001b[94munitPrice\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThis breaks \u001b[94msrc/cart.ts\u001b[39m, which you didn't ask me to touch.\u001b[62GIt\u001b[65Gimports\u001b[73G\u001b[94mLineItem\u001b[82G\u001b[39mand\u001b[86Greads\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[94ma.price\u001b[39m on line 4, so it will fail type-checking until that line is changed to\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[94ma.unitPrice\u001b[39m. I left it alone because you limited the change to \u001b[94mbilling.ts\u001b[39m. Tell me if\u001b[89Gyou\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwant me to\u001b[14Gfix\u001b[18Git\u001b[21Gtoo.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BI didn't run the compiler\u001b[29Gor\u001b[32Gtests,\u001b[39Gsince\u001b[45GI\u001b[47Gdidn't\u001b[54Gsee\u001b[58Ga\u001b[60Gbuild\u001b[66Gscript\u001b[73Gfor\u001b[77Gthis\u001b[82Gproject.\r\u001b[2B\u25cf\u001b[3GRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m stop hook\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[37m\u001b[2m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[22m\u001b[93mStop hook reported a problem\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[37m\u001b[2m[\"/opt/hatchlock/scripts/verify-project.sh\"]: [HatchLock Project Check] The project \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m   \u001b[37m\u001b[2mdoes not pass its checks yet. Fix these errors before finishing:\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[37m\u001b[2m== tsc ==\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[37m\u001b[2msrc/cart.ts(4,38): error TS2339: Property 'price' does not exist on type 'LineItem'.\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[37m\u001b[2msrc/cart.ts(4,48): error TS2339: Property 'price' does not exist on type 'Line